  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovative Mechanisms to Defend Press Freedom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Contributing to fostering press freedom and protecting journalists from hardships, to produce better quality journalism

OUTCOME 1: journalists who are victims of online attacks provided with support and protection.
OUTPUT 1.1: Monitoring reports of online threats and harassment cases are published.
OUTPUT 1.2: Social media sentiment and network analysis reports are published.
OUTPUT 1.3: Communication campaign to reveal results of monitoring and analysis operations is launched.
OUTPUT 1.4: Legal actions are initiated against instigator of threats and harassment operations.

OUTCOME 2: Lebanese photojournalists provided professional and socio-economic support.
OUTPUT 2.1: Online platform listing the portfolio of participating photojournalists is created.
OUTPUT 2.2: Communication and marketing campaign to promote the e-platform is launched.
OUTPUT 2.3: Training curriculum focusing on photojournalists&#x2019; ethics, marketing skills, clients&#x2019; requirements, safety, and legal and intellectual property rights.</narrative>
  </description>
